            {
                "comment": "Marin is amazing!! Very clear and VERY nice!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She definitely knows her stuff! Very knowledgeable and speaks clearly! Participate a lot, raise your hand for everything. The class is very particular because it's all grammar, so study the assigned readings! Some of the quizzes are harder than you'd expect.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Marin was a fantastic! Her Spanish is very clear and she's very accommodating when it comes to helping students. Loved her!!",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She is a fair teacher.  Make sure you participate like crazy in this class because she makes you work for that participation grade.  Very clear instructions and classes.  Not the most energetic, but hey, you're there to learn grammar, and I don't know how interesting that can get.",
